						"title": "Xiaomi Smart Pet Food Feeder Desiccant by GirayAkbay",
						"description": "This model is designed so that the dehydration box in the “xiaomi Smart Pet Food Feeder” machine is refillable.Add pause command mid print. Carefully open the existing dehydration box, enlarge the middle of the felt to 48 mm and place it inside the print and continue printing. Preferably, glue it carefully from the edges with hotglue. (cloth or paper tovel could also work)After printing, it is necessary to cut open the filling hole.The cover of the box can be glued with a non-toxic adhesive after the dessicant is filled. When the dessicant gets humid, it can be removed from the notch on the edge to be replaced and refilled.",
